		"description": "<p>Also at 6th level, your innate knowledge of plants is complete. When you would normally make a check to recall knowledge about any plants or plant monsters, at the Narrator’s discretion you automatically have all desired knowledge. This knowledge also opens additional opportunities for finding rare plants. You gain one of the following @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.tv37v168w5e89vdv]{Secret of Nature}, and it does not count against your number of secrets known:</p><ul><li><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.biDNwDLhFPb9IBOq]{Gather Obscure Medicinals}. You don’t need to meet the prerequisite.</p></li><li><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.g4zq453nbnhm80eo]{Herbal Apothecary}</p></li></ul>",
